{"name":"单选框","description":"单选框是一组只能选中其中一个选项的表单控件 · 选择支付方式或可见范围时，可将少量互斥选项直接列出。每组要有清楚的问题说明；选项较多或需要搜索时应改用 选择器 Select 。","quote":"这几个选项只能选一个，选了新的要把旧的取消掉。","agentPrompt":"把 4 个取货时间段做成一组始终可见的单选项，只允许选一个。请验证点击文字也能选择、键盘可以切换，并且选择新时段会取消旧时段。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-radio\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>单选框<span>Radio</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">这几个选项只能选一个，选了新的要把旧的取消掉。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">单选框是一组只能选中其中一个选项的表单控件</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>选择支付方式或可见范围时，可将少量互斥选项直接列出。每组要有清楚的问题说明；选项较多或需要搜索时应改用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"select\" aria-label=\"选择器 Select\">选择器 <b>Select</b></a>。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"rg-col\">\n        <label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-rd\" checked><i></i>公开</label>\n        <label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-rd\"><i></i>仅成员可见</label>\n        <label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-rd\"><i></i>私密</label>\n      </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>把 4 个取货时间段做成一组始终可见的单选项，只允许选一个。请验证点击文字也能选择、键盘可以切换，并且选择新时段会取消旧时段。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>少量互斥选项</b>，直接平铺便于比较</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio on\"></i>全部</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>进行中</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>已完成</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>隐私、可见范围</b>这类关键设置</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio on\"></i>公开</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>仅成员</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>私密</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">选项<b>需要附带说明</b>：费用、时效写旁边</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio on\"></i>标准配送 <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">免费 · 约 3 天</span></span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>加急配送 <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">¥8 · 明天到</span></span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>支付方式</b>：经典的单选场景</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio on\"></i>支付宝</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>微信支付</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>银行卡</span></div></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">选项较多且难以直接比较：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"select\" aria-label=\"选择器 Select\">选择器 <b>Select</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>北京</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio on\"></i>上海</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>广州</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>深圳</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>杭州</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>成都</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>武汉</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>西安</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>…</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">选项过多，难以快速比较</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">只有一个“<b>同意协议</b>”确认项：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/checkbox?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"复选框 Checkbox\">复选框 <b>Checkbox</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio on\"></i>我已阅读并同意<span style=\"color:var(--brand)\">《用户协议》</span></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">只有一个选项，不需要使用单选组</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">允许<b>多选</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/checkbox?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"复选框 Checkbox\">复选框 <b>Checkbox</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio on\"></i>前端</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio on\"></i>后端</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>设计</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">需要多选时应使用复选框</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">需要取消选择时，增加“无”选项或改用<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/checkbox?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"复选框 Checkbox\">复选框 <b>Checkbox</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio on\"></i>男</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-radio \"></i>女</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">点过的单选取消不掉</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><span class=\"demo-radio\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"dot\"><i class=\"r-dot on\"></i></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"label\">仅自己可见</span></span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"root\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">单选项</span><span class=\"pe\">Radio</span></button><span class=\"pd\">整行都能点，不只是圆点</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"dot\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">圆点</span><span class=\"pe\">Dot</span></button><span class=\"pd\">选中后实心，同组互斥</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"label\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">选项文案</span><span class=\"pe\">Label</span></button><span class=\"pd\">说清楚选了意味着什么</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">默认<span>Default</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr1\" checked><i></i>支付宝</label><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr1\"><i></i>微信</label></div><div class=\"variant-when\">互斥选项不多时的标准形态</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">按钮样式<span>Button</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"radio-btns\"><span class=\"rb on\">按月付</span><span class=\"rb\">按年付</span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">选项少而短，想要更醒目好点</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">带说明<span>With Desc</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"rg-col\"><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr2\" checked><i></i><span class=\"rd\">标准配送<small>免费 · 约 3 天</small></span></label><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr2\"><i></i><span class=\"rd\">加急配送<small>¥8 · 明天到</small></span></label></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">选项要附带费用、时效等解释</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">禁用<span>Disabled</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr3\" disabled><i></i>不可选</label><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b2-vr3\" checked disabled><i></i>已选禁用</label></div><div class=\"variant-when\">某选项当前不可选但仍需展示</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">支付方式选择</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px\"><b>选择支付方式</b><span style=\"color:var(--red);font-weight:600\">¥ 658.00</span></div>\n          <label class=\"demo-radio radio-sc-opt\" style=\"border-top:0\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"r-pay\" checked><i></i><span style=\"flex:1\">🟦 支付宝</span><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">推荐</span></label>\n          <label class=\"demo-radio radio-sc-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"r-pay\"><i></i><span style=\"flex:1\">🟩 微信支付</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">零钱 ¥1,204.50</span></label>\n          <label class=\"demo-radio radio-sc-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"r-pay\"><i></i><span style=\"flex:1\">💳 招商银行储蓄卡 (6688)</span></label>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">性别选择</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px\">完善个人资料</div>\n          <div class=\"radio-sc-field\" style=\"border-top:0\"><span>姓名</span><input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1\" value=\"林小hu\"></div>\n          <div class=\"radio-sc-field\"><span>性别</span><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"r-sex\"><i></i>男</label><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"r-sex\" checked><i></i>女</label><label class=\"demo-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"r-sex\"><i></i>保密</label></div>\n          <div class=\"radio-sc-field\"><span>生日</span><input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1\" value=\"1998-06-15\"></div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">可见范围设置</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px\">谁可以看这条动态？</div>\n          <label class=\"demo-radio radio-sc-opt\" style=\"border-top:0\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"r-vis\" checked><i></i><span class=\"rd\">公开<small>所有人可见，可被推荐</small></span></label>\n          <label class=\"demo-radio radio-sc-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"r-vis\"><i></i><span class=\"rd\">仅好友<small>互相关注的人可见</small></span></label>\n          <label class=\"demo-radio radio-sc-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"r-vis\"><i></i><span class=\"rd\">私密<small>仅自己可见</small></span></label>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">配送方式</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px\">配送方式</div>\n          <label class=\"demo-radio radio-sc-opt\" style=\"border-top:0\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"r-ship\" checked><i></i><span class=\"rd\" style=\"flex:1\">标准配送<small>免费 · 预计 3 天送达</small></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">免运费</span></label>\n          <label class=\"demo-radio radio-sc-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"r-ship\"><i></i><span class=\"rd\" style=\"flex:1\">加急配送<small>明天 18:00 前送达</small></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">+ ¥8</span></label>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><span>送至：杭州市西湖区文三路 100 号</span><a style=\"color:var(--brand)\">修改</a></div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/input/radio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">单选类型输入框</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/radio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">单选组模式</span><span class=\"reference-source\">WAI-ARIA APG ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/radio","markdown":"# 单选框Radio\n\n你可能会说\n这几个选项只能选一个，选了新的要把旧的取消掉。\n\n**单选框是一组只能选中其中一个选项的表单控件**·选择支付方式或可见范围时，可将少量互斥选项直接列出。每组要有清楚的问题说明；选项较多或需要搜索时应改用 [选择器 **Select**](/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh)。\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 把 4 个取货时间段做成一组始终可见的单选项，只允许选一个。请验证点击文字也能选择、键盘可以切换，并且选择新时段会取消旧时段。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **少量互斥选项**，直接平铺便于比较\n\n全部进行中已完成\n- **隐私、可见范围**这类关键设置\n\n公开仅成员私密\n- 选项**需要附带说明**：费用、时效写旁边\n\n标准配送 免费 · 约 3 天\n\n加急配送 ¥8 · 明天到\n- **支付方式**：经典的单选场景\n\n支付宝\n\n微信支付\n\n银行卡\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 选项较多且难以直接比较：使用 [选择器 **Select**](/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh)\n\n北京上海广州深圳杭州成都武汉西安…\n选项过多，难以快速比较\n- 只有一个“**同意协议**”确认项：使用 [复选框 **Checkbox**](/vibe-hub/checkbox?lang=zh)\n\n我已阅读并同意《用户协议》\n只有一个选项，不需要使用单选组\n- 允许**多选**：使用 [复选框 **Checkbox**](/vibe-hub/checkbox?lang=zh)\n\n前端后端设计\n需要多选时应使用复选框\n- 需要取消选择时，增加“无”选项或改用[复选框 **Checkbox**](/vibe-hub/checkbox?lang=zh)\n\n男女\n点过的单选取消不掉\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n仅自己可见\n\n1单选项Radio整行都能点，不只是圆点\n\n2圆点Dot选中后实心，同组互斥\n\n3选项文案Label说清楚选了意味着什么\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n默认Default\n\n支付宝微信\n\n互斥选项不多时的标准形态\n\n按钮样式Button\n\n按月付按年付\n\n选项少而短，想要更醒目好点\n\n带说明With Desc\n\n标准配送免费 · 约 3 天加急配送¥8 · 明天到\n\n选项要附带费用、时效等解释\n\n禁用Disabled\n\n不可选已选禁用\n\n某选项当前不可选但仍需展示\n\n典型使用场景\n\n支付方式选择\n\n**选择支付方式**¥ 658.00\n\n          🟦 支付宝推荐\n          🟩 微信支付零钱 ¥1,204.50\n          💳 招商银行储蓄卡 (6688)\n\n性别选择\n\n完善个人资料\n\n          \n姓名\n\n          \n性别男女保密\n\n          \n生日\n\n可见范围设置\n\n谁可以看这条动态？\n\n          公开所有人可见，可被推荐\n          仅好友互相关注的人可见\n          私密仅自己可见\n\n配送方式\n\n配送方式\n\n          标准配送免费 · 预计 3 天送达免运费\n          加急配送明天 18:00 前送达+ ¥8\n          \n送至：杭州市西湖区文三路 100 号修改\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[单选类型输入框MDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/input/radio)[单选组模式WAI-ARIA APG ↗](https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/radio/)"}